note The frame (platform::App::frame), in order: the font and cell size for this scale factor, the screenshot aid, the five polls, the keys, then a left press releases the focused field unless the press lands on it (Fields::press), then panel_input, the steps list's drag (step_list_input) and the graph's own input phase (or, with the Graph view hidden, the graph marked Hidden and its keyboard Elsewhere, so a look snaps and the arrows walk the tour), the element tree, layout and draw, the action queue, the reveal of the centre view navigation asked for, saving the layout if it changed, and the history snapshot, which first performs a back or forward asked for this frame. It asks the loop to come back at the ANIMATING rate while the graph camera is gliding, in 50 ms while any work is in flight, and in a second otherwise, so an idle window costs one frame per second.

